<div dir=3D"auto">Hi, Logan.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">So I've thought about this, and December doesn't really a=
lign with my intentions.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I'll be in the area for September and I was willing to ex=
tend that an extra month to come back here, but I'm eager to explore more o=
f the coast, and accepting a December assignment would require me to stay i=
n the area for many months longer
 than I intended<span style=3D"font-size: 12pt;">.</span></div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><span style=3D"font-size: 12pt;"><br>
</span></div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><span style=3D"font-size: 12pt;">What I really want is to=
 experience Cape Lookout, Fort Stevens, and Beverly Beach. I applied to the=
 positions those parks posted, but no one responded to me, which is what le=
d me to accept the September posting
 with Franki and exploring any further potential here.</span></div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><span style=3D"font-size: 12pt;"><br>
</span></div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><span style=3D"font-size: 12pt;">I'm also really interest=
ed in Oregon State Forests division - the forest in Tillamook. But I've yet=
 to do my research on this so I haven't reached out to them. And someday ma=
ybe the coast will call less to me and
 I'll be ready to explore what else Oregon has to teach me.</span></div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><span style=3D"font-size: 12pt;"><br>
</span></div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><span style=3D"font-size: 12pt;">I have time. Years, real=
ly, to experience all the things I want to. And I am patient - I understand=
 getting myself in the door at some of these parks may require a longer rec=
ord of service.</span></div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><span style=3D"font-size: 12pt;"><br>
</span></div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><span style=3D"font-size: 12pt;">I appreciate you noting =
the month was available. As noted previously, I hope to come back February =
to April to experience another dune season here. I will wait to hear form y=
ou on that.</span></div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><span style=3D"font-size: 12pt;"><br>
</span></div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><span style=3D"font-size: 12pt;">Thanks for being such an=
 awesome and understanding boss. I really enjoy working with you and hope f=
or continued engagement in the years to come - especially during dune seaso=
n!</span></div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><span style=3D"font-size: 12pt;"><br>
</span></div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><span style=3D"font-size: 12pt;">Sam</span></div>
<div><br>
</div>
