<div>&nbsp;</div>
</div>
<div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Hi, Logan. Thanks for the updates. I would do December if=
 I'm still in the area. Before I commit, let me find out what I'll be doing=
 for October and November first. I'll check back with you and see if the po=
sition is still open when I know more.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">As far as my days off - 7am and 10pm are both times when =
I'm going to be home. The odds of me not be here during those times is prac=
tically nil. I mean, I guess if I end up dating someone and staying at thei=
r house? Whatever. I'm trying to be
 useful - I understand if you want someone else to do it. Offer remains ope=
n however.</div>
<div><br>
</div>
